docs/frontier/
docs/superpowers/
# Blanket-ignore experiment scratch, but track the Kaggriculture study: it is a
# reproducible artifact (a transcribed model plus its findings), not scratch.
# `experiments/*` rather than `experiments/` so the negation can re-include a child --
# git cannot re-include anything under an excluded DIRECTORY.
experiments/*
!experiments/kaggriculture/
